Icons in icons/ are carved from the Prism Launcher binary
(prismlauncher.exe), (c) Prism Launcher contributors, licensed GPL-3.0-only.

Our workspace is already GPL-3.0-only, so the carved GPL assets stay under
the same license. The carved directory itself lives outside this repo and is
never moved; only the mapped PNGs listed below were copied here under
canonical names.

